{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":29.18000030517578,"text":"A creature with a woman's head, a lion's body, and an eagle's wings, over two meters tall. It did not stand on the ground. It was raised on a ten-meter column so it could be seen from far away and look down on anyone coming up the sacred way. The island of Knoxos sent it around 560 BC, when it was rich from its marble. Its pose is calm and its gaze straight ahead, and that is exactly what makes it unsettling.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.6800000071525574},{"word":"creature","start":0.6800000071525574,"end":0.8799999952316284},{"word":"with","start":0.8799999952316284,"end":1.1799999475479126},{"word":"a","start":1.1799999475479126,"end":1.4199999570846558},{"word":"woman's","start":1.4199999570846558,"end":1.8200000524520874},{"word":"head","start":1.8200000524520874,"end":2.0399999618530273},{"word":"a","start":2.4600000381469727,"end":2.680000066757202},{"word":"lion's","start":2.680000066757202,"end":3.0199999809265137},{"word":"body","start":3.0199999809265137,"end":3.299999952316284},{"word":"and","start":3.5199999809265137,"end":3.640000104904175},{"word":"an","start":3.640000104904175,"end":4.119999885559082},{"word":"eagle's","start":4.119999885559082,"end":4.71999979019165},{"word":"wings","start":4.71999979019165,"end":4.71999979019165},{"word":"over","start":5.360000133514404,"end":5.400000095367432},{"word":"two","start":5.400000095367432,"end":5.760000228881836},{"word":"meters","start":5.760000228881836,"end":6.039999961853027},{"word":"tall","start":6.039999961853027,"end":6.440000057220459},{"word":"It","start":7.099999904632568,"end":7.300000190734863},{"word":"did","start":7.300000190734863,"end":7.480000019073486},{"word":"not","start":7.480000019073486,"end":7.820000171661377},{"word":"stand","start":7.820000171661377,"end":8.100000381469727},{"word":"on","start":8.100000381469727,"end":8.279999732971191},{"word":"the","start":8.279999732971191,"end":8.72000